   <taskbody>
      <context>
         <p>The Map view allows you to visually locate motors in your network. You can choose between two viewing modes:</p>
         <ul id="ul_10314188">
            <li>
               <b>Map View</b>: Displays locations using standard map imagery.</li>
            <li>
               <b>Satellite View</b>: Displays a detailed satellite image of the locations.</li>
         </ul>
         <p>To open map or satellite view:</p>
      </context>
      <steps id="steps_10314189">
         <step>
            <cmd>Log in to the SMS web application.</cmd>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>On the top navigation menu, click one of the options:</cmd>
            <info>
               <p>Map – to display map view</p>
               <p>Satellite – to display satellite view</p>
               <p>The Map or Satellite view is displayed with location icons pinpointing the site of motors.</p>
               <fig>
                  <title>placeholder</title>
                  <image height="430" href="../media/image65.png" placement="break" width="602">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
               <p>Figure  Map view</p>
               <fig>
                  <title>placeholder</title>
                  <image height="295" href="../media/image66.png" placement="break" width="602">
                     <alt>placeholder</alt>
                  </image>
               </fig>
               <p>Figure  Satellite view</p>
            </info>
         </step>
         <step>
            <cmd>Click the location icon to view motor data relevant to that location.</cmd>
         </step>
      </steps>
